{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/884450-players-wanted-for-a-very-small-mage-2e-pbp-playtest","id":884450,"title":"Players wanted for a very small Mage 2E PBP playtest.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-07T01:01:48-07:00","id":884450,"title":"Players wanted for a very small Mage 2E PBP playtest.","content":"To help me get a handle from the ST side on some of the new mechanics in Mage 2E, especially new Mage Sight and spellcasting, I'd like to run a little play-by-post thread here. To be clear, this is going to be the equivalent of those D&amp;D starter adventures where you go into a cave to kill a dozen kobolds and avoid a pit trap or two, not anything big or involved, although it will hopefully be interesting enough to be fun for you and keep everyone's attention. You're going to be new mage recruits running through a training course in a Lorehouse or something along those lines, the whole thing will take place in one &quot;dungeon.&quot;<br /> <br /> All you need is the 2E core book, a general familiarity with the new rules (as in, &quot;know what Reach and Yantras and Focused Mage Sight are&quot;), and a willingness to poke stuff and break things and be curious. I want to play with all the tools and lenses starting Mage characters have.<br /> <br /> I'd like to run this for 2 players to keep things simple. First 2 people to express interest are in, and then I'll give you some character creation instructions and we'll be on our way. Excelsior!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T01:05:33-07:00","id":884453,"title":"","content":"I'd be down, but I work a lot. How involved of a PbP is this gonna be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-07T02:30:34-07:00","id":884485,"title":"","content":"Not very. Like 1 small post per day to convey &quot;I cast X spell/take Y action&quot; so we can keep things moving would be good. You won't need to lay on thick description or internal monologue or anything, it's going to be a pretty straightforward dungeon crawl/puzzle setup that's primarily about testing the rules rather than deep characterization or roleplaying, although it's not a total &quot;featureless white room&quot; situation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/foru